member.param:
Reader positioned on the schema document. The caller controls its settings;
            use the  overload for a hardened reader
            (DTD prohibited, no embedded resolution).

member.summary:
XSD 1.1 default attribute group references (xs:schema defaultAttributes="QName";
            at most one per schema document; empty for  compiles).
            Referential integrity and per-type attribute-use computation are later phases.

member.param:
The space-separated namespace attribute tokens
            (##any, ##other, ##targetNamespace, ##local, or namespace URIs);
            ##any when the attribute is absent and no notNamespace attribute is present;
            empty when only notNamespace is present (the constraint has negative variety, per the
            mapping rule in W3C XML Schema 1.1 Part 1 §3.10.2.2).

